 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Roger Corman’s Frankenstein Unbound" href="/whats-on/roger-cormans-frankenstein-unbound" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Roger Corman’s Frankenstein Unbound</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Roger Corman’s final feature as director sees a scientist’s experiments with matter sending him hurtling into the past where he encounters Victor Frankenstein.</p>
  </div>
