  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Saint Omer" href="/whats-on/saint-omer" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Saint Omer</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>This Academy Award-nominated French legal drama is based on the true story a French Senegalese woman accused of killing her mixed-race baby daughter.</p>
