  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Sapphire" href="/whats-on/sapphire" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Sapphire</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>An investigation into the murder of a young woman reveals issues of racial identity and racism in 1950s London.</p>
  </div>
