 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="35 Shots of Rum" href="/whats-on/35-shots-of-rum" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>35 Shots of Rum</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Claire Denis’ outstanding exploration of the human condition explores the everyday experiences of a multiracial community.</p>
