 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Some Like It Hot" href="/whats-on/some-like-it-hot" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Some Like It Hot</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Escaping the mob in drag, two men join a travelling jazz troupe and fall under the spell of Marilyn Monroe, in Billy Wilder’s comic masterpiece.</p>
  </div>
