 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Still a Brother: Inside the Negro Middle Class" href="/whats-on/still-a-brother-inside-the-negro-middle-class" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Still a Brother: Inside the Negro Middle Class</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The director behind experimental documentary classic Symbiopsychotaxiplasm, William Greaves, presents a multilayered interpretation of race and class at a watershed moment in American history.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="workData" role="group" aria-label="Show information" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <time itemprop="duration" datetime="PT1H30M" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>1h 30m</time><span aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>|</span><span data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>1968</span>
  </div>
