 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="Sunset Boulevard" href="/whats-on/sunset-boulevard" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Sunset Boulevard</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>An ageing star of the silent screen finds her isolated world exposed in Billy Wilder and Charles Brackett’s biting satire, which ruffled the feathers of Hollywood’s elite.</p>
  </div>
