 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="The Apartment" href="/whats-on/the-apartment" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The Apartment</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="status" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Sold out</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Jack Lemmon’s C.C. Baxter lives under the heel of his corporate overlords, offering out his home for their extra-marital affairs, until a romance of his own intervenes.</p>
  </div>
