 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="The Cat and the Canary" href="/whats-on/the-cat-and-the-canary" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The Cat and the Canary</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Celebrate Halloween with this splendid creaky house chiller from one of German Expressionist cinema’s master filmmakers.</p>
  </div>
