 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="The Intruder" href="/whats-on/the-intruder" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The Intruder</a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>One of Roger Corman’s most overtly political films focuses on a newcomer to a small Southern US town who whips up racial hatred among the locals.</p>
