 <div class="cardContent" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="The Journey to Gyeong-ju" href="/whats-on/the-journey-to-gyeong-ju" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The Journey to Gyeong-ju<span data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf> - London Korean Film Festival Opening Night</span></a></h3>
   <div class="tagsWrapper" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
    <p class="extras" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>Special screening available</p>
   </div>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>A mother and her daughters embark on a road trip down a twisted, tragicomic path of dysfunctional revenge where genre and tone swerve violently.</p>
  </div>
