  <div data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>
   <h3 data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf="true"><a class="card-link" data-ga-event="showcard_click" data-ga-show-title="The Pit and the Pendulum" href="/whats-on/the-pit-and-the-pendulum" data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>The Pit and the Pendulum</a></h3>
   <p data-astro-cid-idhbdnaf>One of Roger Corman’s most acclaimed films, this is a bold, visually dazzling chiller, featuring a grand guignol finale.</p>
